# Deno writes one of these next to a function's deno.json whenever anyone runs `deno check`
# on it. It pins npm versions the edge runtime then cannot resolve, so a committed lockfile
# breaks the function at boot with "Could not find '@supabase/postgrest-js@...'". None of
# the functions has ever committed one; this keeps it that way.
supabase/functions/**/deno.lock
